    "detailed_description": "<strong>Beat Defender is a fast-paced rhythm action game where you fight hordes of police to defend a group of homeless people, all to the beat of music, working your way up to a <i>special rhythm boss! </i></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1645070/extras/fe6f91346fdf704e3ca50b0c9cd5ea86.poster.avif?t=1626422654\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1645070/extras/fe6f91346fdf704e3ca50b0c9cd5ea86.webm?t=1626422654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1645070/extras/fe6f91346fdf704e3ca50b0c9cd5ea86.mp4?t=1626422654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Police Are On The Attack!</h2>Cut them all down, every last one of them! FOR THE FULL COMBO! <br>With precise attack and parry timing, flawlessly defend the homeless people from the incoming villains, all while earning points with beautiful &quot;Excellent&quot; ratings and unlocking more content! Upload custom maps to the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong> where you can play other custom levels, made by fellow players, all while supporting charity just by playing the game!<br><br><strong>Notable Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Swooshy sword attacks<br></li><li>Kawooshy sword parries<br></li><li>Action-packed levels with music by friends Paranoise and Gabo<br></li><li>Slightly less action-packed menus<br></li><li>A super sick final boss<br></li><li>An equally sick donation of <strong>100% of Developer Proceeds to the Denver Rescue Mission,</strong> a nonprofit that supports those without homes!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Beat Defender is a fast-paced rhythm action game where you fight hordes of police to defend a group of homeless people, all to the beat of music, working your way up to a <i>special rhythm boss! </i></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1645070/extras/fe6f91346fdf704e3ca50b0c9cd5ea86.poster.avif?t=1626422654\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1645070/extras/fe6f91346fdf704e3ca50b0c9cd5ea86.webm?t=1626422654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1645070/extras/fe6f91346fdf704e3ca50b0c9cd5ea86.mp4?t=1626422654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Police Are On The Attack!</h2>Cut them all down, every last one of them! FOR THE FULL COMBO! <br>With precise attack and parry timing, flawlessly defend the homeless people from the incoming villains, all while earning points with beautiful &quot;Excellent&quot; ratings and unlocking more content! Upload custom maps to the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong> where you can play other custom levels, made by fellow players, all while supporting charity just by playing the game!<br><br><strong>Notable Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Swooshy sword attacks<br></li><li>Kawooshy sword parries<br></li><li>Action-packed levels with music by friends Paranoise and Gabo<br></li><li>Slightly less action-packed menus<br></li><li>A super sick final boss<br></li><li>An equally sick donation of <strong>100% of Developer Proceeds to the Denver Rescue Mission,</strong> a nonprofit that supports those without homes!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In this experimental Action Rhythm Game, embrace the art of the blade to score points and cut notes in a song! Defend your local homeless community from the evil that threatens them, while we donate 100% of Developer Proceeds to the Denver Rescue Mission, supporting homeless people in Denver, CO!",
